VENDORED LIBRARY
================
Name:       RealtimeTTS
Version:    0.4.x (vendored snapshot)
Upstream:   https://github.com/KoljaB/RealtimeTTS
License:    MIT

Purpose:
  Provides real-time text-to-speech streaming for Aether's
  hands-free voice interface.  Vendored to integrate Aether's
  custom TTS engines (Qwen3, Qwen3-MLX, Kokoro) and to bundle
  with the production binary.

Modification policy:
  - Aether adds custom engines under RealtimeTTS/engines/.
  - The core RealtimeTTS/ library is upstream code.
  - TODO/FIXME/HACK comments inside RealtimeTTS/ are upstream
    issues, NOT Aether technical debt.
  - Aether-authored engines are clearly marked with @.architecture.
